[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0010","text":"“眷恋的心　是万花筒”……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0020","text":"“不停　旋转　摇曳　然后”———"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0022","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0030","text":"辛苦了，凛世"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0040","text":"制作人大人……\n那个……凛世的朗诵……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0050","text":"非常棒\n诗的意境仿佛沁入了心里一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0060","text":"凛世……放心了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0070","text":"嗯！最后那首诗，那种思念到心痛的\n感觉都传达过来了，让人好感动啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0080","text":"是、是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0090","text":"……咦，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31200400_01_0100","text":"没有……\n谢谢……您……"}]
